### Now, the coverage counting.

Let me write a shared helper in `EstadoDAG.jl` (or generadores) to classify the first defect. Actually, to avoid duplication, define in `EstadoDAG.jl`:

```julia
"""
Primer defecto de forma v4 del bloque en el orden de las transacciones
(`:cbid`, `:orden_igual`, `:orden_desc`) o `nothing`. Es exactamente la
precedencia que aplica `chequear_forma_evidencia`.
"""
function primer_defecto_forma(A::Admision, b::BloquePost)
    cbid_red = A.pd.P.cbid
    for tx in b.txs
        tx.tipo == Transicion.TxEvidencia || continue
        ev = tx.evidencia
        ev === nothing && continue
        (ev.id1.cbid == cbid_red && ev.id2.cbid == cbid_red) || return :cbid
        if !(ev.h1.pre_hash < ev.h2.pre_hash)
            return ev.h1.pre_hash == ev.h2.pre_hash ? :orden_igual : :orden_desc
        end
    end
    return nothing
end
```

And `chequear_forma_evidencia` could be implemented with it:
```julia
function chequear_forma_evidencia(A, b)
    d = primer_defecto_forma(A, b)
    d === nothing && return nothing
    d === :cbid && return MOTIVO_FORMA_CBID
    return MOTIVO_FORMA_ORDEN
end
```
Export `primer_defecto_forma`. This centralizes.

